The selected page (`.active`) and `:hover` status styles for the mobile navigation dropdown in dark mode have been updated to `#000000` in [`css/navigation.css`](https://github.com/KyleBemmann/kylebemmann.github.io/blob/main/css/navigation.css#L376-L383).

### Changes Made
- Added a dark mode rule within the mobile media query (`@media only screen and (max-width: 1024px)`):
  ```css
  .darkmode nav ul li ul li a:hover,
  .darkmode nav ul li ul li a.active,
  :root.darkmode nav ul li ul li a:hover,
  :root.darkmode nav ul li ul li a.active {
    background: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  ```
- Your changes have been saved and will automatically commit and push to the repository.
